OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancer counselling helped me with
OL,4,Adark feelings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman living with blood cancer said a
OL,7,Ffree counselling service helped her and
OL,8,Fher family cope by giving them the
OL,9,Fchance to bring "dark feelings out into
OL,10,Fthe light".
OL,12,FEmma Tom, from Chalford in
OL,13,FGloucestershire, began sessions with
OL,14,FLinc, a blood cancer charity based in
OL,15,FGloucester, after her diagnosis three
OL,16,Fyears ago.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
