OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancer counselling helped me with
OL,4,Adark feelings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity was previously based in
OL,7,FGloucestershire Royal Hospital and
OL,8,FCheltenham General Hospital, but has
OL,9,Fnow expanded its services to the
OL,10,Fcommunity with the guarantee of no wait
OL,11,Ftimes, providing it receives enough
OL,12,Fsupport.
OL,14,FTom said: "I think the only way for me
OL,15,Fto be able to work through the fear of
OL,16,Fthe situation was just to bring those
OL,17,Fdark feelings out into the light."
